{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-fusion","title":"知识融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction/knowledge-fusion","wordCount":1009,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识融合\">知识融合</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>知识融合（Knowledge Fusion）是将来自多个异构数据源的知识整合为统一、一致的知识图谱的过程。不同数据源对同一实体可能有不同的标识、描述甚至矛盾的属性值，知识融合通过实体对齐、属性融合和冲突消解来解决这些问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 多源知识&#10;        S1[数据源 1] --&gt; E1[实体集 A]&#10;        S2[数据源 2] --&gt; E2[实体集 B]&#10;        S3[数据源 3] --&gt; E3[实体集 C]&#10;    end&#10;    E1 --&gt; EA[实体对齐]&#10;    E2 --&gt; EA&#10;    E3 --&gt; EA&#10;    EA --&gt; AF[属性融合]&#10;    AF --&gt; CR[冲突消解]&#10;    CR --&gt; UKG[统一知识图谱]\">graph TB\n    subgraph 多源知识\n        S1[数据源 1] --&gt; E1[实体集 A]\n        S2[数据源 2] --&gt; E2[实体集 B]\n        S3[数据源 3] --&gt; E3[实体集 C]\n    end\n    E1 --&gt; EA[实体对齐]\n    E2 --&gt; EA\n    E3 --&gt; EA\n    EA --&gt; AF[属性融合]\n    AF --&gt; CR[冲突消解]\n    CR --&gt; UKG[统一知识图谱]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>融合任务</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>核心挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实体对齐</td>\n<td>识别不同源中的同一实体</td>\n<td>实体对</td>\n<td>对齐映射</td>\n<td>名称变体、上下文差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体消歧</td>\n<td>区分同名但不同的实体</td>\n<td>同名实体</td>\n<td>消歧结果</td>\n<td>上下文不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性融合</td>\n<td>合并多源的属性信息</td>\n<td>多源属性</td>\n<td>统一属性</td>\n<td>属性语义不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突消解</td>\n<td>处理矛盾的属性值</td>\n<td>冲突属性</td>\n<td>最可信值</td>\n<td>来源可信度不明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本体对齐</td>\n<td>映射不同本体的概念</td>\n<td>两个本体</td>\n<td>概念映射</td>\n<td>粒度和视角差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实体对齐方法\">实体对齐方法</h2><p>实体对齐（Entity Alignment）是知识融合的核心任务。它需要判断来自不同知识图谱的两个实体是否指向同一个现实世界对象。传统方法基于字符串相似度和属性匹配，现代方法利用知识嵌入在向量空间中对齐实体。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EntityAlignmentConfig {&#10;  nameWeight: number;&#10;  attributeWeight: number;&#10;  structureWeight: number;&#10;  threshold: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface AlignmentCandidate {&#10;  sourceEntity: Entity;&#10;  targetEntity: Entity;&#10;  nameSimilarity: number;&#10;  attributeSimilarity: number;&#10;  structureSimilarity: number;&#10;  overallScore: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeNameSimilarity(name1: string, name2: string): number {&#10;  const jaroWinkler = jaroWinklerDistance(name1, name2);&#10;  const jaccard = jaccardSimilarity(ngrams(name1, 2), ngrams(name2, 2));&#10;  return 0.6 * jaroWinkler + 0.4 * jaccard;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeAttributeSimilarity(&#10;  attrs1: Map&lt;string, string&gt;,&#10;  attrs2: Map&lt;string, string&gt;,&#10;  alignedProperties: Map&lt;string, string&gt;,&#10;): number {&#10;  let matchCount = 0;&#10;  let totalCount = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const [prop1, prop2] of alignedProperties) {&#10;    const val1 = attrs1.get(prop1);&#10;    const val2 = attrs2.get(prop2);&#10;    if (val1 &amp;&amp; val2) {&#10;      totalCount++;&#10;      if (valueSimilarity(val1, val2) &gt; 0.8) matchCount++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return totalCount &gt; 0 ? matchCount / totalCount : 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function alignEntities(&#10;  sourceKG: KnowledgeGraph,&#10;  targetKG: KnowledgeGraph,&#10;  config: EntityAlignmentConfig,&#10;): AlignmentCandidate[] {&#10;  const candidates: AlignmentCandidate[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const srcEntity of sourceKG.entities) {&#10;    const nameCandidates = targetKG.searchByName(srcEntity.label, 10);&#10;&#10;    for (const tgtEntity of nameCandidates) {&#10;      const nameSim = computeNameSimilarity(srcEntity.label, tgtEntity.label);&#10;      const attrSim = computeAttributeSimilarity(srcEntity.properties, tgtEntity.properties, new Map());&#10;      const structSim = computeStructureSimilarity(srcEntity, tgtEntity, sourceKG, targetKG);&#10;      const overall =&#10;        config.nameWeight * nameSim + config.attributeWeight * attrSim + config.structureWeight * structSim;&#10;&#10;      if (overall &gt;= config.threshold) {&#10;        candidates.push({&#10;          sourceEntity: srcEntity,&#10;          targetEntity: tgtEntity,&#10;          nameSimilarity: nameSim,&#10;          attributeSimilarity: attrSim,&#10;          structureSimilarity: structSim,&#10;          overallScore: overall,&#10;        });&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return stableMatching(candidates);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityAlignmentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  nameWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attributeWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  structureWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span cl